{
  "answer": "**答案:** 新加坡数码发展及新闻部(Ministry of Digital Development and Information,MDDI)。\n\n据报道,MDDI 常任秘书 Kai Fong Chng 与 Anthropic 联合创始人 Ben Mann 签署了这份谅解备忘录。内容涉及 AI 安全、安保与模型评测,AI 应用及其影响的研究,以及公共和私营部门的负责任采用。\n\n有一处时间上的出入:e27 称 MOU 是周二签的,办公室开设则是周三宣布的。其他多数媒体把签署日期算在 10 月 14 日的发布当天。\n\nSources:\n- [Anthropic Opens Singapore Office, Signs Government MOU (AI Weekly)](https://aiweekly.co/alerts/anthropic-opens-singapore-office-signs-government-mou)\n- [Anthropic 官方公告:singapore office opening](https://anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening)\n- [Marketing-Interactive](https://www.marketing-interactive.com/anthropic-opens-sg-office-partners-govt-on-ai-safety)\n- [e27](https://e27.co/anthropics-singapore-mou-bets-on-safety-testing-not-consumer-reach-20261014)\n- [Devdiscourse](https://www.devdiscourse.com/article/business/3992335-anthropic-opens-office-in-singapore-partners-with-government-on-ai-safety-and-adoption)",
